ata-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Legs\"><img alt=\"Zaoan Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Legs_4de993.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Zaoan Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Armor_4fa0e1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Zaoan Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Robe_0509fd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mercenary Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mercenary_Sword_0a8719.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.54<br/>December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Muggy Plains</b> is an area after the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonblaze%20Peaks\">Dragonblaze Peaks</a> accessible through an ancient lizard teleport located on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppe</a>. This teleporter is only available to players who have completed the first eight missions of <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>.\n</p><p>Those plains are ruled by all kind of High class lizards. In the <b>Muggy Plains</b>, you can also find <a href=\"#/wiki/Chaochai\">Chaochai</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stampor%20Cave\">Stampor Cave</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Dragon%20Dojo\">Fire Dragon Dojo</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>, one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug%20Caves\">Brimstone Bug Caves</a> and the ferry to <a href=\"#/wiki/Chazorai\">Chazorai</a>.\n</p><p>The surface is a great hunting spot for paladins until they are able to hunt with Diamond Arrows. They must be wary though, as the location is <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Raids\">occasionally infested</a> with hundreds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Lancer%20Beetle\">Lancer Beetles</a> notorious for their distance skill reduction.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Muggy Plains NPCs (10 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Tunnel%20Guard\">Lizard Tunnel Guard</a></td><td 